4 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]$ and $T(u)=[\\begin{aligned}12 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}],$ what is the standard matrix of $T?$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $T=\\,\\,$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  |  | $0$ | {{field-3}} |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, we are told that $T$ represents a stretch along the $x$-axis or $y$-axis.\n\nComparing the $x$- and $y$-components of $u$ and $T(u),$ we note the following:\n\n- the $y$-components of $u$ and $T(u)$ are the same, while\n\n- the $x$-component of $T(u)$ is $3$ times the $x$-component of $u.$\n\nSo, we conclude that $T$ represents a stretch of scale factor $3$ in the $x$-direction. \n\nTherefore, the standard matrix of $T$ is\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-317606/field-1" "q-317606/field-2" "q-317606/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3105e8eb-010f-542b-9e40-12fda6ea00e7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-317606"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-317612/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "8bb58a72-7e75-5153-af35-f855c7ebcc06" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317612/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "7543c6eb-e15d-5105-8824-c47648ce8987" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317612/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "a3bf16ba-e936-5c3b-8838-41bfcee22fff" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317612/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-317612/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-317612/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa30